WEBVTT

00:19.820 --> 00:24.191
Tozasareta kioku no
naka no kizu ga

00:24.191 --> 00:28.796
Oto mo naku kokoro
ni fureru toki ni

00:28.796 --> 00:36.100
Yasashiku hohoemu sono ura
ni wa kodoku no namida

00:36.537 --> 00:41.342
Hateshinai tsuyosa motomete

00:41.342 --> 00:52.152
Shinjiru monotachi to
nando mo kakeagare

00:52.152 --> 00:54.221
Mamoritai

00:54.221 --> 00:56.523
Shinjitai

00:56.523 --> 01:00.728
Egao no wake wo subete

01:00.728 --> 01:05.165
Hageshisa mo itoshisa mo

01:05.165 --> 01:09.370
Zenbu uketomeru yo

01:09.370 --> 01:12.973
Nidoto sono te wo hanasanai

01:12.973 --> 01:21.847
Ano hikari wo mezashite...

01:31.258 --> 01:34.716
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:35.696 --> 01:37.164
I see.

01:37.164 --> 01:41.396
This child... He was
the one who set me free?

01:42.503 --> 01:44.368
The dragon deity of Kifune.

01:47.207 --> 01:50.335
I see. This is good stuff.

01:52.012 --> 01:54.615
An injury that doesn't heal...
A permanent injury...

01:54.615 --> 01:59.820
Abe no Seimei will have no
other heir, but Masahiro.

01:59.820 --> 02:02.812
Touda and I have agreed
on that.

02:03.657 --> 02:06.922
I see. Then I'll believe
in you.

02:09.730 --> 02:12.893
A Voice in Response
to a Faint Wish

02:34.188 --> 02:37.391
Takaokami no Kami,
the dragon deity of Kifune?

02:37.391 --> 02:38.792
Why are you here?

02:38.792 --> 02:41.829
Well! A worthy shikigami
spirit indeed.

02:41.829 --> 02:43.797
Nothing escapes your eyes.

02:44.631 --> 02:46.600
Don't worry, shikigami.

02:46.600 --> 02:49.970
After I have completed
my task, I'll leave this body.

02:49.970 --> 02:51.839
Keep your word.

02:51.839 --> 02:54.441
The wound that Masahiro
sustained earlier...

02:54.441 --> 02:57.740
...has yet to fully heal.
- Nevertheless...

02:58.946 --> 03:02.382
He has a pretty strong will
for a human.

03:02.382 --> 03:04.751
Don't hesitate to approach
me if you need help.

03:04.751 --> 03:07.187
But that will depend
on whether...

03:07.187 --> 03:10.724
I can hear your voice
like the previous time.

03:10.724 --> 03:14.161
I'm sure you didn't come
just to tell me that,

03:14.161 --> 03:16.095
Takaokami no Kami.

03:18.132 --> 03:22.169
The foreign demons have left
Kifune and are ready for action.

03:22.169 --> 03:23.904
Is that so?!

03:23.904 --> 03:27.340
You can choose to
believe me or not.

03:27.841 --> 03:29.910
I have said what
I wanted to say.

03:29.910 --> 03:32.970
But be warned that
I am infallible.

03:34.781 --> 03:36.442
Masahiro!

03:40.120 --> 03:43.490
Making use of his body
when he's still a patient...

03:43.490 --> 03:45.014
Oh...

03:45.392 --> 03:47.661
He could actually
make that deity...

03:47.661 --> 03:50.264
sit up and take notice.
That's great...

03:50.264 --> 03:51.632
Seimei...

03:51.632 --> 03:56.103
Geez, that eccentric deity really
has a soft spot for Masahiro.

03:56.103 --> 03:58.731
He really is troublesome.

03:59.406 --> 04:02.876
I see... So the foreign
demons have left Kifune,

04:02.876 --> 04:04.945
and are already executing
their plan?

04:04.945 --> 04:08.073
I wonder what they
are up to now...

04:12.920 --> 04:14.888
My body has become weaker.

04:14.888 --> 04:17.724
I've been cooped up in
the house for too long.

04:17.724 --> 04:20.294
Don't overstrain your body!

04:20.294 --> 04:23.297
You're still recovering
from the injuries!

04:23.297 --> 04:27.234
Well... Somehow, I feel
much better today.

04:27.234 --> 04:31.038
My body was like lead a few days
ago. It's much lighter now!

04:31.038 --> 04:32.973
It seems...

04:32.973 --> 04:35.309
It's as if Grandfather
had cast a spell...

04:35.309 --> 04:37.243
to make things right
all at once.

04:38.245 --> 04:41.315
Deity of Kifune, you were
responsible for that, right?

04:41.315 --> 04:43.617
I'll go help out at
the dorms today.

04:43.617 --> 04:46.853
What?! You plan to serve
at the onmyou dorms already?!

04:46.853 --> 04:50.591
I'll be all right.
I've fully recovered.

04:50.591 --> 04:53.727
Do you think Yoshimasa
will allow you to do that?

04:53.727 --> 04:55.829
We have to deal with Kyuuki
and the demons.

04:55.829 --> 04:58.593
I can't possibly lie
in bed all the time.

05:05.572 --> 05:09.610
As far as I know,
everything's fine at the capital.

05:09.610 --> 05:11.812
- Yeah.
- Then...

05:11.812 --> 05:14.248
What are the demons
doing right now?

05:14.248 --> 05:18.184
My my, look at who we
have here. It's Masahiro.

05:19.886 --> 05:24.024
Are you all right? I heard
that you were bedridden.

05:24.024 --> 05:26.393
Yes, I'm all right now.

05:26.393 --> 05:29.196
Where are you headed,
Lord Yukinari?

05:29.196 --> 05:31.999
Well, we have received
numerous reports of people...

05:31.999 --> 05:34.234
being spirited away
across the capital.

05:34.234 --> 05:37.567
I have been assigned to
investigate these incidents.

05:38.272 --> 05:40.007
Spirited away?

05:40.007 --> 05:43.010
People have been vanishing
in recent days.

05:43.010 --> 05:46.213
If this goes on, the people's
unease may go out of hand.

05:46.213 --> 05:50.115
If an ayakashi is found
to be responsible...

05:50.817 --> 05:54.021
We'll need the assistance
of the onmyou dorms.

05:54.021 --> 05:58.425
- We'll count on you then.
- Yes, I'll inform my father.

05:58.425 --> 06:01.292
I have great confidence in you.

06:01.995 --> 06:04.731
- Thank you!
- All right...

06:04.731 --> 06:08.068
Masahiro, remember not
to overstrain yourself.

06:08.068 --> 06:09.467
Yes.

06:10.270 --> 06:14.007
The foreign demons could
be responsible for this.

06:14.007 --> 06:15.942
Let's go to Kifune tonight.

06:15.942 --> 06:19.479
- They have left Kifune.
- Is that so?

06:19.479 --> 06:23.350
Actually... the deity of Kifune
came here and told me that...

06:23.350 --> 06:26.019
while you were still
asleep this morning.

06:26.019 --> 06:29.189
What?! I didn't notice
at all!

06:29.189 --> 06:33.660
Oh! I didn't even pay my respects
to the the deity who helped me!

06:33.660 --> 06:36.229
I'm going to be reprimanded!
Cursed!

06:36.229 --> 06:38.131
Divine punishment
will befall me!

06:38.131 --> 06:40.167
Well, you don't have
to be too worried.

06:40.167 --> 06:41.828
All right!

06:42.269 --> 06:44.863
We'll go to Kifune tonight
to show our gratitude.

06:55.582 --> 06:58.418
Why is Rikugou following us?

06:58.418 --> 07:00.909
He's probably under
the orders of Seimei.

07:06.460 --> 07:08.862
You mean that the
Imperial Palace fire,

07:08.862 --> 07:11.965
as well as the slayings of
the priests at Kifune...

07:11.965 --> 07:15.869
The foreign demons were
responsible for all that?

07:15.869 --> 07:19.406
That's right. I, Seimei,
am deeply apologetic...

07:19.406 --> 07:24.478
for my tardiness in reporting
to you, Lord Michinaga.

07:24.478 --> 07:27.848
I'm willing to bear any
punishment that you mete out.

07:27.848 --> 07:29.383
Don't worry.

07:29.383 --> 07:33.220
The Mikado and I believe serious
disasters would be averted...

07:33.220 --> 07:35.722
if you're allowed to
handle everything.

07:35.722 --> 07:38.058
You shouldn't treat
this lightly.

07:38.058 --> 07:40.293
What are you saying?

07:40.293 --> 07:43.597
We need not fear those
foreign demons...

07:43.597 --> 07:46.800
with Yoshimasa, Masahiro
and you around.

07:46.800 --> 07:48.267
We're honored.

07:55.842 --> 07:59.713
Thank you,
dragon deity of Kifune.

07:59.713 --> 08:04.017
I'm sorry that it took me
this long to show my gratitude.

08:04.017 --> 08:07.087
I apologize. You paid us
a visit this morning.

08:07.087 --> 08:10.490
But I was ignorant of your visit
and continued to sleep.

08:10.490 --> 08:13.660
A destiny that even deities
are embroiled in... Interesting.

08:13.660 --> 08:16.797
Despite all that, he's
Seimei's heir after all.

08:16.797 --> 08:18.398
I see.

08:18.398 --> 08:21.168
Rikugou, are you fine
with that?

08:21.168 --> 08:23.937
Seimei acknowledged him
as his heir.

08:23.937 --> 08:26.371
- And that's enough for me.
- I see...

08:30.310 --> 08:32.145
Everything's settled then.

08:32.145 --> 08:34.581
All right, I'm done here.
Let's go back.

08:34.581 --> 08:37.217
That's it? I was expecting
something more elaborate.

08:37.217 --> 08:40.277
It's fine. I was very
dedicated to it.

08:44.124 --> 08:45.926
A firefly?

08:45.926 --> 08:48.094
It's probably the
last one this year.

08:48.094 --> 08:51.461
If only Akiko could see it.

08:51.798 --> 08:54.801
- She'd be delighted.
- Yeah.

08:54.801 --> 08:59.761
Let's ask Akiko to come with us
to see the fireflies next year.

09:00.941 --> 09:03.143
You shouldn't be out here
at night in your condition.

09:03.143 --> 09:05.907
- Let's go.
- Y-Yeah.

09:10.784 --> 09:14.550
Answer!

09:16.289 --> 09:22.387
Answer! Answer!

09:25.065 --> 09:27.590
I can't answer him.

09:28.168 --> 09:29.795
They are here again!

09:34.574 --> 09:37.244
- Answer!
- Not again...

09:37.244 --> 09:40.146
No way. If I reply to
that voice...

09:40.146 --> 09:42.808
Help me, Masahiro.

09:49.122 --> 09:52.526
No, I can't tell
Masahiro about this.

09:52.526 --> 09:55.662
I don't want to expose
him to danger anymore.

09:55.662 --> 09:57.789
Answer!

10:23.823 --> 10:27.294
Princess... Masahiro is here.

10:27.294 --> 10:28.862
Masahiro?

10:28.862 --> 10:30.730
On behalf of my grandfather,

10:30.730 --> 10:34.029
I've come to make sure
that you are safe and sound.

10:42.242 --> 10:43.944
It's been a while.

10:43.944 --> 10:47.243
I heard that you fainted.
Are you feeling all right?

10:47.781 --> 10:51.585
Oh, I had fallen asleep
yesterday due to exhaustion.

10:51.585 --> 10:53.485
Don't worry.

10:54.421 --> 10:56.556
Something is wrong, right?

10:56.556 --> 10:59.759
Grandfather's barrier has
weakened drastically too.

10:59.759 --> 11:03.196
- Why didn't you tell us?
- If I did...

11:03.196 --> 11:06.833
You'd definitely pursue
the matter, wouldn't you?

11:06.833 --> 11:08.368
Of course!

11:08.368 --> 11:12.930
Then you could probably be
seriously wounded again, right?

11:14.341 --> 11:16.076
About that incident with
Miss Keiko...

11:16.076 --> 11:21.014
You wouldn't have been
wounded if I'd been less selfish.

11:21.014 --> 11:24.150
You haven't fully recovered
from the previous injury, right?

11:24.150 --> 11:28.521
If you knew about this, you'd
force yourself to come, and...

11:28.521 --> 11:30.724
- No... I...
- You were wounded...

11:30.724 --> 11:33.293
- because of me!
- That's... hold on...

11:33.293 --> 11:36.729
I don't want you to
risk your life anymore!

11:37.097 --> 11:39.065
All right, listen to me.

11:39.766 --> 11:42.235
You didn't cause me
to be injured.

11:42.235 --> 11:44.571
The incident happened
as I'm still a trainee.

11:44.571 --> 11:49.065
Such things will never happen
again. So don't worry.

11:49.709 --> 11:53.146
Inform me right away
when something is wrong.

11:53.146 --> 11:54.704
All right?

11:55.515 --> 11:57.107
Yes.

11:57.217 --> 11:59.519
So what happened?

11:59.519 --> 12:01.453
Please tell me.

12:02.522 --> 12:06.626
Ayakashi have appeared almost
nightly for the past fortnight.

12:06.626 --> 12:08.962
What type of ayakashi?

12:08.962 --> 12:12.999
I'm not sure. I didn't
step out of this place.

12:12.999 --> 12:15.468
However, they should be
the comrades...

12:15.468 --> 12:18.369
of the monsters who
captured me previously.

12:19.139 --> 12:21.341
The ayakashi do not speak.

12:21.341 --> 12:24.936
I think it's their master
who talks to me.

12:26.513 --> 12:29.346
- This area of the garden?
- Yes.

12:30.150 --> 12:32.519
No signs of their aura
were left behind.

12:32.519 --> 12:35.555
Akiko, no matter what, you must
never answer that voice.

12:35.555 --> 12:37.691
And hold on tightly to
the protective charm.

12:37.691 --> 12:41.821
Yes. I will call you so
please protect me, okay?

12:42.729 --> 12:44.219
I promise.

12:45.899 --> 12:48.268
Akiko, have you ever
seen fireflies?

12:48.268 --> 12:49.769
Fireflies?

12:49.769 --> 12:53.073
I've only seen fireflies that
were set free in the garden.

12:53.073 --> 12:55.775
I came across the
last firefly in summer...

12:55.775 --> 12:57.766
when I was in Kifune
last night.

12:58.445 --> 13:02.282
There're many fireflies around
in the middle of summer.

13:02.282 --> 13:05.118
I'm sure it is
a magnificent sight.

13:05.118 --> 13:08.788
Yeah, it's too late to
catch them this year.

13:08.788 --> 13:11.052
Let's go and see
them next year.

13:11.925 --> 13:14.627
I'd love to go, but...

13:14.627 --> 13:18.563
It's no use. I won't be
able to leave the house.

13:19.632 --> 13:22.726
Don't worry.
I'll take you there.

13:23.970 --> 13:27.373
- I'll find a way.
- Really?

13:27.373 --> 13:30.103
It's a promise then.

13:30.877 --> 13:32.606
Right!

13:36.616 --> 13:40.177
It's a promise. We'll go see
the fireflies next summer.

13:40.787 --> 13:42.414
Absolutely.

13:44.891 --> 13:48.520
It's pretty hot out here
considering that it's autumn now.

13:53.199 --> 13:54.701
Please excuse me.

13:54.701 --> 13:58.204
I asked you to
check on Miss Akiko.

13:58.204 --> 14:01.901
But you took such a long
time to come back.

14:02.776 --> 14:06.479
Lord Michinaga had called
for me after I visited Akiko.

14:06.479 --> 14:10.279
He instructed me to give
this letter to you, Grandfather.

14:16.122 --> 14:18.558
- My entry into the court?
- Yes.

14:18.558 --> 14:22.695
I've given Seimei the task of
picking a lucky day in winter.

14:22.695 --> 14:24.664
Oh, congratulations!

14:24.664 --> 14:29.335
You'll become the Mikado's
wife one day, Princess.

14:29.335 --> 14:31.200
That's right.

14:35.675 --> 14:38.278
How is Princess Akiko?

14:38.278 --> 14:41.047
She seems all right.

14:41.047 --> 14:45.318
But ayakashi have appeared almost
nightly for the past fortnight.

14:45.318 --> 14:47.787
So the barrier has weakened
considerably.

14:47.787 --> 14:49.355
Just as I expected.

14:49.355 --> 14:53.291
The foreign demon, Kyuuki,
is probably the cause of it.

14:54.294 --> 14:56.863
I have already fixed the barrier,

14:56.863 --> 14:59.165
but it won't last very long.

14:59.165 --> 15:04.569
Well then, I have to make a trip
to the East Third Palace.

15:12.045 --> 15:15.715
I won't be able to go...
Next year...

15:15.715 --> 15:18.451
If I enter the palace, I...

15:18.451 --> 15:22.387
Masahiro and I won't be able
to see the fireflies together.

15:24.023 --> 15:26.159
Though we made a promise...

15:26.159 --> 15:29.925
And linked our pinkies...
I'm sorry, Masahiro.

15:32.498 --> 15:34.125
A firefly?

15:45.078 --> 15:47.569
Answer.

15:49.415 --> 15:52.009
Answer.

15:52.418 --> 15:57.651
If you answer me,
your wish will be granted

16:06.966 --> 16:08.263
Masahiro!

16:11.704 --> 16:14.774
That aura! It's coming from
the East Third Palace.

16:14.774 --> 16:17.402
- The barrier has been breached.
- It's impossible!

16:20.680 --> 16:22.949
- Masahiro, let's go!
- Yes!

16:22.949 --> 16:25.315
- Mokkun, go ahead.
- I understand!

16:32.525 --> 16:35.828
I'm sorry. I'm sorry...

16:35.828 --> 16:37.887
Though we made a promise...

16:40.066 --> 16:42.135
Our worthy master indeed.

16:42.135 --> 16:45.138
He caught that girl
without much effort.

16:45.138 --> 16:47.874
Humans are such
fragile creatures.

16:47.874 --> 16:51.477
Master's power will
increase significantly...

16:51.477 --> 16:55.413
if he drinks her blood
and eats her flesh.

16:59.819 --> 17:03.482
- I'm your opponent!
- How dare you!

17:07.293 --> 17:09.329
- She's over there.
- We found her.

17:09.329 --> 17:11.664
- This is good stuff.
- For our master!

17:11.664 --> 17:14.599
- We'll surely!
- You're irritating!

17:20.707 --> 17:23.733
So... who wants to die next?

17:31.284 --> 17:33.411
I refuse to let you proceed!

17:37.190 --> 17:38.919
Seimei!

17:40.059 --> 17:42.228
Lord Michinaga!

17:42.228 --> 17:47.033
Seimei... I'm glad you came.
Please protect Akiko.

17:47.033 --> 17:49.802
You must not let
the demons hurt her.

17:49.802 --> 17:51.371
Yes.

17:51.371 --> 17:54.574
Masahiro!
Please explain yourself!

17:54.574 --> 17:56.542
When you came over just now,

17:56.542 --> 17:59.212
you assured me that
everything was fine.

17:59.212 --> 18:02.875
- That's...
- Masahiro, go.

18:06.619 --> 18:09.856
- Lord Michinaga, the truth is...
- What?

18:09.856 --> 18:12.692
My grandson is not to blame...

18:12.692 --> 18:16.362
...for the chaotic situation now.
- What are you saying?

18:16.362 --> 18:19.665
I can detect the aura
of the demons' master.

18:19.665 --> 18:22.702
Furthermore, I suspect
that it had used...

18:22.702 --> 18:26.139
a despicable method to
get to Princess Akiko.

18:26.139 --> 18:31.210
Otherwise, the demons could
never have broken the barrier...

18:31.210 --> 18:33.678
that I, Abe no Seimei,
have set up.

18:40.086 --> 18:44.523
Akiko! Akiko, hang on!
Akiko!

18:45.858 --> 18:50.129
This wound is... a curse.
Why didn't I think of it earlier?

18:50.129 --> 18:52.398
They made use of
Akiko's body...

18:52.398 --> 18:55.424
to breach the barrier
from the interior.

18:56.469 --> 19:01.771
Masahiro... I-I'm sorry.

19:03.743 --> 19:08.237
I'm sorry...
I promised to protect you...

19:10.883 --> 19:14.375
The scent is able
to resist evil.

19:15.988 --> 19:18.724
The sachet that
I carry around...

19:18.724 --> 19:21.955
should have stronger
spiritual power.

19:24.831 --> 19:28.835
The evil energy in Akiko's
body is creating chaos...

19:28.835 --> 19:31.037
and causing her immense pain.

19:31.037 --> 19:33.506
What should I do now?

19:33.506 --> 19:38.144
Guren, could you do a
thorough check in the house?

19:38.144 --> 19:40.980
- Demons may be lurking around...
- I get it.

19:40.980 --> 19:43.005
I'll set them ablaze
with my flames!

19:43.683 --> 19:47.141
Masahiro, the letter
Lord Michinaga gave me...

19:48.087 --> 19:49.789
I must pick a lucky day...

19:49.789 --> 19:53.589
for Princess Akiko's court entry
as an Imperial Bride.

19:54.927 --> 19:58.397
She won't be able to
see the fireflies...

19:58.397 --> 20:01.594
That's why she apologized
to me.

20:02.368 --> 20:06.339
To lift the curse that's
been cast on Princess Akiko,

20:06.339 --> 20:10.042
we have to seek out the
foreign demons right away.

20:10.042 --> 20:13.679
She won't be able to
withstand the pain for long.

20:13.679 --> 20:17.617
Thus, I have chosen to
bear her burden...

20:17.617 --> 20:21.220
by transferring
the curse to myself.

20:21.220 --> 20:23.823
The foreign demons
must be eliminated...

20:23.823 --> 20:26.459
before Princess Akiko
enters the court.

20:26.459 --> 20:29.826
I have something to
ask of you, Grandfather.

20:51.851 --> 20:55.254
- Masahiro, what's wrong?
- Oh, Mokkun.

20:55.254 --> 20:58.524
Tell me. What happened?

20:58.524 --> 21:02.187
Akiko is apparently entering
the court in the winter.

21:03.196 --> 21:04.754
I see...

21:05.565 --> 21:10.298
Although we had made a promise...
to see the fireflies together.

21:13.372 --> 21:16.676
Mokkun, we must
find Kyuuki.

21:16.676 --> 21:19.145
Yeah, we'll definitely
seek out...

21:19.145 --> 21:22.215
those foreign demons
and eliminate them.

21:22.215 --> 21:24.784
Akiko can then go to court
without worries.

21:24.784 --> 21:27.878
That's right. We can do it.

21:42.802 --> 21:54.213
Fukai yami no naka de kimi
no koe ga kikoeta

